{\fs40\ulw Special Values}\par
The following values have special effects in addition to their normal effects.\par
\par
{\b\ulw Events}\par
Event 00: This event is the default event for when "No Event" is needed.\par
\par
{\b\ulw Doors}\par
Door 00: This door leads to the Waterfall Log Bridge at the start of the game. Using it prevents the status bar palettes from being loaded.\par
\par
{\b\ulw Equipment}\par
BareHead (Index: 00): This is the equipment that the party is equipped with when they do not have a helmet equipped.\par
No (Index: 15): This is the equipment that the party is equipped with when they do not have an armor equipped.\par
Nothing (Index: 2A): This is the equipment that the party is equipped with when they do not have an accessory equipped.\par
}